Ilanic's Scroll	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Ilanic's Scroll","wikiPath":"/Ilanic's_Scroll","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Erudin Palace","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Josper Kenshed","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Spell: Column of Frost (sells for 2pp)"},{"text":"7 silver pieces"}],"card":{"title":"Ilanic's Scroll","lines":["Minimum Level: 5","Classes: Wizard","Related Zones: Toxxulia Forest","Related NPCs: A Kobold Caster, Ilanics Skeleton","Required Faction: Amiable or better"]},"links":["Erudin","Josper Kenshed","Wizard","Toxxulia Forest","A Kobold Caster","Ilanics Skeleton","Column of Frost","Half of a Spell","Crimson Hands","High Council of Erudin","Heretics","High Guard of Erudin"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Josper Kenshed","text":"Come forward and speak. What is it you seek within these walls? Let it be the knowledge of wizardry. for that is what we are. Only a [servant of wizardry] should be within these walls."},{"npc":"Josper Kenshed","text":"A servant. you say? If you be a young apprentice. perhaps you might assist me? I could use you to [collect components]. If you believe yourself to be beyond such things. you may wish to assist me with a [special matter]."},{"npc":"Josper Kenshed","text":"An old friend of mine, Ilanic, can not rest till he his research is finished. If I only know what he was working on. Goto the forest of Toxxulia and seek him out. Bring me back what information you can find about what he was researching before his demise."},{"npc":"Ilanics Skeleton","text":"Kobold! Kobold!"},{"npc":"Josper Kenshed","text":"Go now and use his research to aid yourself. Seems that I lack the will to use Ilanic's knowledge for my better good."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T08:23:45.382Z","outOfEra":false}
