Urako's Big Mistake	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Urako's Big Mistake","wikiPath":"/Urako's_Big_Mistake","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Grobb","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Urako","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Kaglari Mana Doll","item":"Kaglari Mana Doll","wikiPath":"/Kaglari_Mana_Doll"}],"card":{"title":"Urako's Big Mistake","lines":["Minimum Level: 1","Classes: Shaman","Related Zones: Feerrott, Oggok, Innothule Swamp","Related NPCs: Clurg, Chef Dooga, A lizardman scout, A froglok"]},"links":["Grobb","Urako","Shaman","Feerrott","Oggok","Innothule Swamp","Clurg (NPC)","Chef Dooga","A lizardman scout","A froglok","Kaglari Mana Doll","Grobb Oven Mittens","Carver Cagrek","Froglok Meat","The Baker","Basher Nanrum","Ogre Butcher Apron","Pickled Froglok","Ship in a Bottle","The Butcher","Basher Sklama","The Captain","Basher Avisk","Lizardman Scout Fife","The Feerrott","The Minstrel","Dark Ones","Shadowknights of Night Keep","Frogloks of Guk"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Urako","text":"Me says hi to you. What you want from me? Oh!! Me shaman trainer. You must be shaman. Are you [shaman Darkone]?"},{"npc":"Urako","text":"You choose rite if you bes a shaman. Wes da best. You remember ta not get in Kaglari way. He get mad berry easy. He gets berry mad at Urako if he finds out me make [big mistake]."},{"npc":"Urako","text":"Kaglari makes Urako cleans his kwarters. He says nots to open closet. Me make mistake and opens his closet and out comes da skeletons. Dey runs out into Grobb. Me needs ta gets dem back before Kaglari finds out. Me needs sumwun to [collect Kaglari skeletons]."},{"npc":"Urako","text":"Tank you!! Dere is fours of dem. You can finds dem here in Grobb. I no tink dey will want to come homes to Kaglari's closet. You ask dem to [come back to the closet] and see whut dey say. If you gets dem back me promise to gives you a [Kaglari mana doll]."},{"npc":"Urako","text":"Kaglari catch many humans. He pull spirit from dem and force into dolls. Now deir spirit give shaman extra mana. Dey good power source. Now humans good for someting. Da mana dolls only for shaman power."},{"npc":"a skeleton","text":"Sorry. Nothing to sell at this time. Maybe later. Good day."},{"npc":"a skeleton","text":"Back to the closet?!! I just got out. I would go back if I had a pair of Oven Mittens."},{"npc":"a skeleton","text":"Ahh!! Oven Mittens!! Kinda' large, don't you think?!! Oh well, now I can bake all I want without burning my hands. OK!! Let's go. I overheard some Basher named Nanrum saying he spotted my friend, The Butcher. You should ask him [wheres the skeleton]."},{"npc":"Basher Nanrum","text":"Peh! What you wanted?! I am Basher Nanrum. You? _______? Heh, you look for works? Hmm, me tinks you too weakling for [job] me need done. Hmm.. You might do, mebbe."},{"npc":"Basher Nanrum","text":"Yeah!! Me see that bone man. He over by da Carver. He tink he butcher or sumting!!"},{"npc":"a skeleton","text":"Hello there!"},{"npc":"a skeleton","text":"Darn!! I was just starting to have fun. Tell you what. You find me a nice Ogre Butcher Apron and I will gladly go back to my cramped quarters."},{"npc":"a skeleton","text":"Thanks!! Now I'm a real butcher just like Carver Cagrek!! Ok, before you take me back, we need to find my friend The Captain. Last I heard, he was boating around the swamp. Ask the guards outside if they have [seen the captain]."},{"npc":"Basher Sklama","text":"Me hear dat dere are humans, elves and other weaklings hunting in da swamp."},{"npc":"Basher Sklama","text":"The bone captain? Him funny ting. Him ask me where ta find a boat. Me says me seen wun up north, but it not so gud boat. Lotsa holes. He go anyway. Mebbe him sink, mebbe not."},{"npc":"a skeleton","text":"Yes?"},{"npc":"a skeleton","text":"If I must...but only if I can take a bit of my former life with me inside the closet. Since my boat is broken, bring me a Ship in a Bottle and I will accept my fate."},{"npc":"a skeleton","text":"At least I can dream I'm on this ship out on the wide open sea...Thanks friend. You know what would make being in that closet easier? Having my friend The Minstrel playing music. I heard Basher Avisk trying to hum a tune that I know The Minstrel plays a lot. Maybe he knows where to find The Minstrel. Hmm...I doubt he'll know what a minstrel is...better ask him about the [tune] he's always humming."},{"npc":"Basher Avisk","text":"Hey dere."},{"npc":"Basher Avisk","text":"Yous like da toon me hum? Me hum gud! Me hears it sumtimes when me walks by da Dark Ones place. Dey gots strong majik back dere, me gets funny feeling in me tummy."},{"npc":"a skeleton","text":"Come to enjoy my music?"},{"npc":"a skeleton","text":"No!! I'm getting so good!! Even these trolls appreciate my music! <sigh>...fine I'll go. But before I do, can you do me a favor first? I'd like to study a new instrument. I hear that some lizardmen near the ogre city make an interesting instrument called a fife. If you can get me a few samples, say four, just to make sure I get a good quality one, I'll gladly go back in the closet."},{"npc":"a skeleton","text":"Oh good, you got four!! I hope at least one of them is of decent quality. Well, guess I should keep up my end of the bargain. Let's go."},{"npc":"Urako","text":"Ohh, tank you!! Kaglari not hafta do bad tings to Urako!! Me berry berry happy!! Oh, here is da doll, me tanks you a lot!!"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T08:32:02.343Z","outOfEra":false}
