Chalice of Conquest Quest	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Chalice of Conquest Quest","wikiPath":"/Chalice_of_Conquest_Quest","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Butcherblock Mountains","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Dru Razbind","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Soil of Underfoot","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Soil_of_Underfoot"},{"name":"Foot of Candlestick","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Foot_of_Candlestick"},{"name":"Stem of Candlestick","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Stem_of_Candlestick"},{"name":"Candle of Bravery","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Candle_of_Bravery"},{"name":"Honeycomb","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Honeycomb"},{"name":"Klunga's Bracelet","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Klunga%27s_Bracelet"},{"name":"Abandoned Orc Shovel","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Abandoned_Orc_Shovel"},{"name":"Blood Stained Note (Klunga's Blood)","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Blood_Stained_Note_(Klunga%27s_Blood)"},{"name":"Chalice of Conquest","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Chalice_of_Conquest"},{"name":"Cape of Underfoot","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Cape_of_Underfoot"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Holy Partisan of Underfoot","item":"Holy Partisan of Underfoot","wikiPath":"/Holy_Partisan_of_Underfoot"}],"card":{"title":"Chalice of Conquest Quest","lines":["Minimum Level: 35","Classes: Paladin","Related Zones: Dagnor's Cauldron, Rathe Mountains, South Kaladim, Halas, Lake Rathetear","Related NPCs: Datur Nightseer, Dok, Ghilanbiddle Nylwadil, Nicholas, Priestess Ghalea"]},"links":["Butcherblock Mountains","Dru Razbind","Paladin","Dagnor's Cauldron","Rathe Mountains","Kaladim","Halas","Lake Rathetear","Datur Nightseer","Dok","Ghilanbiddle Nylwadil","Nicholas","Priestess Ghalea","Holy Partisan of Underfoot","Soil of Underfoot","Foot of Candlestick","Stem of Candlestick","Candle of Bravery","Honeycomb","Klunga's Bracelet","Abandoned Orc Shovel","Blood Stained Note (Klunga's Blood)","Chalice of Conquest","Cape of Underfoot","Paladins of Underfoot","North Kaladim","Merchants of Halas","Wolves of the North","Shamen of Justice","Exiled Legionnaire","Captain Klunga","Eldritch Collective","Dark Reflection","The Dead","Gem Choppers","King Ak`Anon","Chalice Case","Clerics of Underfoot","Kazon Stormhammer","Miners Guild 249","Veeshan"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Dru Razbind","text":"Greetings, my friend. What brings you so far from the trodden path? I hope you do not plan on stealing my [fishing spot]."},{"npc":"Dru Razbind","text":"I need this spot! I fish to feed my growling tummy. I can no longer [venture into Kaladim] and eat in its fine taverns."},{"npc":"Dru Razbind","text":"I have been disgraced! I used to be a respected paladin of the Church of Underfoot until I failed to complete a very [important task] for Lord Datur Nightseer. He stripped me of my Cape of Underfoot. I cannot walk the halls of Kaladim without my cape."},{"npc":"Dru Razbind","text":"I was ordered by Lord Nightseer to carry the [Chalice of Conquest] to a noble band of paladins in the mountains of Rathe. While there, the entire camp was overtaken by a band of orcs. During the battle there was a [strange occurrence]."},{"npc":"Dru Razbind","text":"A large fray raged. Brave, valiant paladins fought vile, green-skinned orcs and while this happened, I spied the [Chalice of Conquest] being taken away from the camp. I was then distracted by a well placed orcish blade. After I defeated the orcs in my way, I turned to see a blue orc running toward the horizon. I gave chase to no avail. I lost the chalice and all respect. If only a [noble Paladin of Underfoot] would assist me..."},{"npc":"Dru Razbind","text":"How dare you approach a member of the Clerics of Underfoot?! Dogs such as you lie in the same bed as aviaks and ogres!"},{"npc":"Dru Razbind","text":"Yes, you shall do, noble _____. Take this. This is the Chalice Case. It is intended for the Chalice of Conquest and the [Candle of Bravery]. If you should get both, be sure to place them within the Chalice Case and combine them. Take the full Chalice Case to Lord Nightseer in Kaladim and I shall be redeemed and you shall surely earn a fine paladin's reward. Let your quest begin in the mountains of Rathe."},{"npc":"Dru Razbind","text":"The Candle of Bravery is ceremonial and is lit when one sips from the [Chalice of Conquest]. The candlestick was left with a fellow Paladin of Underfoot in the Rathe Mountains. The candle itself was lost and I do not know where Priestess Ghalea purchases them."},{"npc":"Nicholas","text":"Greetings, friend. I am the keeper of the [Boots of Ro]. Please rest here with us in our camp of righteousness. No harm can come to you while we paladins keep watch."},{"npc":"Nicholas","text":"You must be the one Sir Dru of Kaladim sent to retrieve the candlestick which was broken in the [orc onslaught]. I have only this piece in my possession as the other portion was taken by an [odd druid] of these mountains. Should you reclaim it, I am sure the maker of the candlestick can patch it together."},{"npc":"Nicholas","text":"The orcs attempted to take the hill, as they do on a frequent basis. We repelled them, of course, but a [blue orc] rushed off with the [Chalice of Conquest]. Where he came from, I do not know. He was no part of the battle! I believe he just found an opportune moment to loot our camp."},{"npc":"Nicholas","text":"I had a visiting ranger track him to his camp near Lake Rathetear. I spied the camp and saw his lifeless body near two other blue orcs. Apparently, he must have taken a fatal blow, but had enough stamina to make it to his camp. I returned the following day with my fellow paladins and found the camp long gone. The ranger, who was still with us, found two sets of tracks leading away. We found [orc remnants]."},{"npc":"Nicholas","text":"Here. We found this worthless orc bracelet with the name Klunga on it. There was also an orc shovel and a bag of Cauldron prawns. We left them, of course. The camp has now been taken over by the green-skinned orcs. I would advise you to stay clear of this camp in Lake Rathe."},{"npc":"Nicholas","text":"The mountains have been plagued not only by beasts, but by evil druids! They attempt to force all men from this land. One has stolen the foot of the candlestick which holds the [Candle of Bravery]. I remember that battle cry of hers, 'Long live the green!'."},{"npc":"Priestess Ghalea","text":"The Candle of Bravery is used for temple ceremonies here in Kaladim. When the candle burns out, I must venture to the frigid village of Halas far to the north of the continent of Antonica. There I will take the candlestick and the [soil of Underfoot] to Dok. He must create the candle in the very ornate candlestick."},{"npc":"Priestess Ghalea","text":"I can trust you with the soil of Underfoot, but first you must obtain four portions of fairy dust. Return them to me and I shall mix it and pray over it. Then I shall give you a pouch of soil of Underfoot."},{"npc":"Dok","text":"I can make ye a Candle o' Bravery. I'll need th' candlestick, or pieces of it! And I need a honeycomb. Oh! And I need a pouch o' Underfoot soil as well."},{"npc":"Dok","text":"Here is your Candle o' Bravery."},{"npc":"Ghilanbiddle Nylwadil","text":"What business do you have here?! Trying to keep safe? Expecting us to fight your battles? Bah!"},{"npc":"Ghilanbiddle Nylwadil","text":"Looking for the chalice, are you? Ha! I don't know where it is, but I know a [lost soul] who does and he could lead you right to it. He had a taste of it and now he can't get enough. He is sort of under the weather, or do I mean under the ground? Ha!"},{"npc":"Ghilanbiddle Nylwadil","text":"The orc named Captain Klunga knows where it's buried. Unfortunately, his time on Norrath has passed. I happen to know two things... one, he is buried somewhere in this territory and two, I can [raise Klunga] and he can show you where the chalice is."},{"npc":"Ghilanbiddle Nylwadil","text":"I can raise Captain Klunga if I have a portion of his blood, an item he once owned and the most important part, 100 gold coins! Hehe! A gnome's got to make a living, you know?"},{"npc":"Ghilanbiddle Nylwadil","text":"The deal was - an article of Klunga's and his blood along with my fee of 100 gold coins and you will have his resurrection."},{"npc":"Ghilanbiddle Nylwadil","text":"The deal was - an article of Klunga's and his blood along with my fee of 100 gold coins and you will have his resurrection."},{"npc":"Ghilanbiddle Nylwadil","text":"Biggily boo, biggily borc... Raise that stinky orc! Bamm! Okay! It's done. Now all you have to do is find him in the spot where his soul left him and give him an orc shovel. Oh! I didn't mention that? Oh, well. I'm sure you can find one... somewhere. Now, get lost before I turn you into a toad!"},{"npc":"Datur Nightseer","text":"The chalice is returned! Praise be to Brell! You have proven yourself to our church and have earned our respect. Let me welcome you into our brotherhood with the Cape of Underfoot. Wear it with pride as all of our finest paladins do."},{"npc":"Dru Razbind","text":"I thank you, my friend. You are truly a great paladin and noble addition to our ranks. I now can walk in Kaladim. Take this as a reward. It is the Holy Partisan of Underfoot. It is now yours. I believe it still has a couple of charges. Use it wisely as the only cleric able to recharge it was lost amid the lava filled lands of Antonica."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T08:43:33.433Z","outOfEra":false}
